{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JOS","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"約書亞記","commonName":"約書亞記","title":"約書亞記","order":6,"numberOfChapters":24,"sha256":"fb26417ceb168e7629022de9a02c144329d5b24a06f89f1b31937f655bc96a8f","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":24,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOS/24.json","totalNumberOfVerses":654},"chapter":{"number":20,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["避難城"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和華對約書亞說："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「你吩咐以色列人，照我以前藉摩西所吩咐你們的，設立一些城邑作為避難城，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["好讓誤殺人的可以逃到那裡，躲避報血仇的人追殺。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["他要逃到避難城，站在城門口向城中的長老們陳明事情的經過，長老們就把他收容到城裡，給他提供住處，讓他留在那裡。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["如果報血仇的人追到，長老們不可把他交出來，因為他是無意殺的，跟被殺者無冤無仇。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["他要住在城內，直到在會眾面前受了審訊，並且還要等到在任的大祭司死後，才可離城回鄉。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["於是，民眾便設立拿弗他利山區加利利境內的基低斯、以法蓮山區的示劍和猶大山區的基列·亞巴，即希伯崙作為避難城。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["他們又在約旦河東岸、耶利哥東面空曠的平原上設立呂便支派的比悉，迦得支派基列境內的拉末和瑪拿西支派巴珊境內的哥蘭作為避難城。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["這是為以色列人和那些從外地來寄居的人所設立的避難城，誤殺了人的可以逃到那裡，不致未在會眾面前受審便死在報血仇的人手裡。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOS/20.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOS/21.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOS/19.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":9}